<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JER" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Jeremaia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jeremaia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jeremaia</para>
  <para style="mt">Jeremaia</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JER 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 6:13" />Yawe yegl dugwa, Na yobanama we, ye yoba kade ya yoba yoko meglkwa i, mudu ere mogl, yoba bakagl tedre, mige moni mina erikwa. Te, na kana kep yoba ya tawa narikwa yoba ama yegl keme ersre, <verse eid="JER 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 6:14" />na yobanama num demara Kor yenabe didre, tu wakai sikrikwa. Ye Israel yoba di teigwa i, Nono wakai muniwe digwa. Yegl digwa ba i ta manugwa. Ye wakai ta moglkrimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JER 6:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 6" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JER 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 20:4" />Jeremaia ere mogl, tawa togwa yagl i yegl di togwa, Ene we, Yawe ene yegl di tome dugwa. Na ene ere kide ere tebo, ene ya ene kabaglenen akie kudugl podo goraiglkwa. Te, ene kan motn, ene Juda yoba kudano ikne ye ene kabaglenen si goraiglkwa. Na Babilon yoba kingno ene Juda yoba mudu kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo erabedi ere edenaglka pre diga. Ye yobuglo ere, Juda yoba tau si goglsre, tau si kane si i pi dumo Babilon edenabuka. <verse eid="JER 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 20:5" />Te, na ere edibo, ene kudano ikne ye dumo Jerusalem suna i taragl mige podo boglkwa ya bonagana mudu idre, ene Juda yoba kingno taragl bona sigwa i, ama mudu i ede dumo Babilon enaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JER 20:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 20" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JER 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 23:23" />Ana Yawe ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Na God siragl mere moglmedi prime? dugwa. Na dumo magigl keme moglsre, dumo eglke ta moglkrumedi primo? <verse eid="JER 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 23:24" />Dumo atne ta yogwa, yoba ta dumo i teke panan, na ta kankraglka dumo yegl ta yomo? Ta manugwa. Na kamun mina ibo ya dumo makan mina ama dumo pra pra mogl kuno eriwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JER 23:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 23" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JER 32" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 32:17" />Yagl Kade Yawe yo, ene yobugln podo paugo, kamun mina ibo ya dumo makan ere yenga. Taragl ta yubunde panan, ene erekratnga, ta yekrukwa.<verse eid="JER 32:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 32" />
</usx>